#: 01-evernight.qml:18
msgctxt "@info:window"
msgid "Evernight Vista New User Guide"
msgstr "Amnir n useqdac amaynut n Evernight Vista"

#: 01-evernight.qml:19
msgctxt "@info:usagetip"
msgid ""
"The following tools can help you get started quickly and enhance your system "
"experience."
msgstr ""
"Ifecka-a d yitranen i k-yellan atan ad ak-d-yefken tazwara akked usnifel n "
"tarmit-ik n unagraw."

#: 01-evernight.qml:46
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Nvidia Driver Manager"
msgstr "Amefrak n yiseɣḍanen n Nvidia"

#: 01-evernight.qml:52
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"If you have an NVIDIA graphics card, use the NVIDIA Driver Manager to "
"install drivers. The Evernight Vista kernel can recognize most hardware "
"drivers, and these drivers can work automatically without installing extra "
"drivers, but NVIDIA drivers need proprietary ones to work properly or to get "
"better performance."
msgstr ""
"Ma tesɛiḍ takarḍit unadim NVIDIA, seqdec Amefrak n yiseɣḍanen NVIDIA i "
"usebded n yiseɣḍanen. Ibel (kernel) n Evernight Vista yezmer ad d-yerr "
"tamussni ɣef uksar n yiseɣḍanen n warrum, yerna yiseɣḍanen-a zemren ad kkren "
"s wudem awurman war ma tesbeddeḍ yiseɣḍanen-nniḍen, maca yiseɣḍanen n "
"NVIDIA sran i yiseɣḍanen imaɣlayen akken ad kkken akken iwata neɣ ad awḍen "
"tussfa yettwaḍfen."

#: 01-evernight.qml:59 01-evernight.qml:102 01-evernight.qml:145
#: 01-evernight.qml:188
msgctxt "@action:button"
msgid "Start"
msgstr "Bdu"

#: 01-evernight.qml:89
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Install Software & Update System"
msgstr "Sebded asseɣlaw u senqed anagraw"

#: 01-evernight.qml:95
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Miryu Package Manager can provide security updates, feature updates, and "
"kernel updates for the Evernight Vista operating system, helping to maintain "
"its security, boost performance, and add support for new hardware. In "
"addition, you can also install software from flatpak and linyaps in the "
"Miryu Package Manager."
msgstr ""
"Miryu Package Manager yezmer ad d-yefk ileqman n tterkilt, ileqman n "
"tmahilin d ileqman n yibelgen i unagraw n wammel Evernight Vista, ay d-"
"yettallen ad yefk lehhu i tterkilt-ines, ad yesnifel tamɣilt-ines ad yernu "
"tallelt i warrum amaynut. Daɣen, tzemreḍ ad tesbeddeḍ aseɣlaw si flatpak "
"akked linyaps deg Miryu Package Manager."

#: 01-evernight.qml:132
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "System Settings"
msgstr "Iɣewwaren n unagraw"

#: 01-evernight.qml:138
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Open the KDE system settings, and you can set up your Evernight Vista "
"operating system your way, like configuring peripherals and appearance."
msgstr ""
"Ldi iɣewwaren n unagraw KDE, tzemreḍ ad tesεedkeḍ anagraw-ik n wammel "
"Evernight Vista s tarrayt-ik, am twila n yisallen uffir d urem."

#: 01-evernight.qml:175
msgctxt "@title:row"
msgid "Btrfs Assistant"
msgstr "Amatewwri n Btrfs"

#: 01-evernight.qml:181
msgctxt "@info"
msgid ""
"Using the Btrfs assistant to set up Snapper and create Btrfs snapshots can "
"help you easily roll back the system in case of problems after updating or "
"other issues."
msgstr ""
"Aseqdec n umatewwri n Btrfs i twila n Snapper d tmerna n tugniwin n Btrfs "
"yezmer ad ak-d-yefk tallelt i tririt n unagraw s talwit deg teγmast n ugur "
"ticki yettwalqem neɣ n wuguren niḍen."

